= Successor review: force a chosen graph divisor
24 November 2026 · Local Rust metadata audit · Producer evidence UNVERIFIED

The dense H2 cost study is consumed. A new relation finder should exploit graph state before paying for algebra. The proposed H6 constructor forces a selected existing quadratic divisor Q into a principal function, then searches only its remaining support. No gain or novelty is claimed.

